*  
*             E T A - U M A
*    Table file for Eta Ursa Majoris flux standard 
*    based on data from STScI ( see Turnshek et al. 
*    AJ, 99, 1243, 1990 ). Data extracted from STSDAS 
*    table held in CALSPEC directory at STScI. Fluxes 
*    formed from Voyager, IUE and optical ( Oke and 
*    others ) data. Note that these are fitted continuum 
*    fluxes, not directly measured fluxes and so should be 
*    treated in the same way as Fillipenko and Greenstein 
*    standards
*
SET .Z.UNITS = "milli-Janskys" 
SET .Z.LABEL = "Flux" 
